WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.146
When a command takes a while,

2
00:00:02.146 --> 00:00:06.000
you can start it from pi and come
back when you want the output.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.206
You start the test suite with slash jobs.

4
00:00:10.206 --> 00:00:12.875
The prompt is free again while it runs.

5
00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:15.544
Open the job list, select the test run,

6
00:00:15.544 --> 00:00:19.240
and the log viewer follows
it until the process exits.

7
00:00:23.633 --> 00:00:28.353
Use the job list to get back to the output
of a command you already have running.
